Summary
AI Marketing Automation & Grok Agent Expert Needed

We’re looking for an experienced AI automation / AI agent expert to build a complete marketing and sales automation system for our technology company.

We want to create multiple AI agents/bots that work together to automate a significant part of our marketing and outbound sales operation.

We currently use HubSpot and are interested in using Grok/xAI, together with tools such as n8n, APIs, and other AI models where appropriate.

The system should include agents capable of:

Finding and researching potential customers and companies
Identifying relevant decision-makers
Enriching leads with company and contact information
Creating personalized outbound email campaigns
Generating personalized LinkedIn messages
Creating follow-up sequences automatically
Generating customized marketing content for each prospect
Creating personalized images using the prospect’s building/property
Monitoring responses and deciding the appropriate next action
Updating leads, activities, and statuses automatically in HubSpot
Creating internal company agents for marketing, sales, research, and content
Building workflows where multiple AI agents can collaborate
Providing analytics and reporting on agent activity and campaign performance

We are not looking for someone who simply knows how to create prompts or basic automations.

We need someone who understands how to architect a production-level AI agent and marketing automation infrastructure that can eventually handle thousands of prospects.

Required experience:

Strong experience with Grok/xAI agents or API, AI agents, n8n or similar automation platforms, HubSpot integrations, APIs/webhooks, LLMs, lead enrichment, email automation, and ideally LinkedIn automation.

Experience building real AI sales or marketing agent systems is highly preferred.

When applying, please send:

Examples of AI agents or marketing automation systems you have built
Your experience with Grok/xAI
Your experience with HubSpot + n8n
The architecture you would recommend for this project
Which tools/APIs you would use
Estimated timeline for an initial working version

Important: Please start your application with the words “AI AGENT” so we know you read the full description.

This can become a long-term engagement as we plan to build multiple AI agents across the company.